WEBVTT

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:46.000
All united in this place of prayer, each individual soul joined in community of worship. One God.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
La Elaha Ella Allah

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Alhamdu Lillah. Wa Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:11.000
This, IN SHAA ALLAH, will be the most important KHUTBA I've ever delivered so far.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.000
So, please pay attention, a special attention this time.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.000
I will try to repeat the important points and I want you to bear in mind that I'm

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
talking to you, you. Don't say he's talking to somebody else.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Recently, I have come to a very important conclusion about believing in God,

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:44.000
and this started in the Muslim Perspective issue of February 1987,

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.000
with the title Satan Believes in God.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.000
It dawned on me that throughout the Quran we are taught

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
that the majority of believers in God are going to Hell.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
In SURA 12, verse 103 says most people no matter what you do will not believe

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:13.000
and then in 106, we're told that the majority of those who believe will go to Hell.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:20.000
This is in SURA 12 verse 106, and then we read

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:29.000
in SURA Al-Mu'minûn, number 23 verses 84 through 90.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:36.000
I'm gonna quote starting at 84. Say, to whom belongs the Earth and

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:44.000
everyone in it if you know? They will say to God! Say would you then take need?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.000
or how come you do not take heed?

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Say, who is the Lord of the Heavens, the seven universes, the Lord with the great Dominion?

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:59.000
They will say God! Say how come you do

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:03.000
not observe righteousness or do not observe God?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Say, in whose hand is the Kingship of everything, over everything, the One that

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.000
can come to your help and does not need any help, if you know? They will say: God!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:24.000
Say how come you, you have been bewitched, have been... have gone astray? So,

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:31.000
And in SURA 29 verse 61 says if you ask them who created the Heavens and the Earth

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.000
and committed the Sun and the Moon? They will say: God! and then the verse ends by

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.000
asking how come they deviated?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:47.000
In SURA 29 verse 63, it says if you ask them who sends water

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:53.000
from the sky to revive dead land? They will say: God! Say praise be to God, how

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.000
come most of them do not understand? So, all these verses and many more

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:03.000
throughout Quran tell us that people believe in God. Satan believes in God, but

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.000
they're still going to Hell. Now why? And the very important conclusion is you

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:15.000
do not believe in God unless you know God as He really is with all His qualities,

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:22.000
namely, especially that God runs everything, that God is doing everything.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.000
And this will shed a new light on our submission to God,

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:33.000
our acceptance of whatever is happening to you personally, or in the world,

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:38.000
to anybody, to anything, to any country.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.000
We do not believe in God unless we believe that God is running everything.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.000
And at this point, I would like to suggest a ZIKR for you, something for you to do.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.000
Every day, wherever you go, when you're driving, or sitting, or you have

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.000
nothing to do, or even if you have something to do, I want this to dominate

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:07.000
your life even mentally, even when you're doing something, I want you to repeat

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:15.000
always God is running everything, God is running everything. This is your new ZIKR, our new ZIKR.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:23.000
Because it will, it will... the whole world will look different to you. When anything is happening that may turn you into

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:33.000
an objector, not a submitter, this will remind you that God is doing everything and that you are objecting.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:38.000
As a believer, you have no business losing your temper, for example.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:42.000
You're not a believer if you lose your temper. And as I said that at the beginning

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.000
of the KHUTBA, I'm talking to you. Don't say he's talking to somebody else.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:52.000
I'm talking to you, yes you, Abdullah, Gatut, Mohtasham, Ahmad, the other Ahmad,

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:58.000
Frank and so on. I am talking to you, every one of you. You have no business losing

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.000
your temper because this indicates you're objecting to something God is doing.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:07.000
We must know that God is doing everything, even the things that Satan is

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:11.000
doing, they are following God's law.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:19.000
A good example in the Quran is before the creation of Adam, God is telling the

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:25.000
angels I'm putting on earth a representative

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:30.000
which in a nutshell says that God of course knew that Adam was gonna be

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:37.000
duped by Satan, and will go down to Earth, because after when Satan tricked Adam,

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.000
God said go down to Earth all of you.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.000
But this, before the creation of Adam, God is telling the angels I'm going to

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:53.000
place on the planet Earth a representative, the human being.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:07:00.000
So, even though Satan tempted Adam and Eve, God is doing everything

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:06.000
because everything is going in accordance with God's will.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.000
This is our new ZIKR when you're driving, when you're sitting, when you're

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.000
doing anything. Eventually, it's gonna happen mentally every cell in your body

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:19.000
is gonna say God is running everything.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:24.000
And this is the true believer. This is the believer in God who will not go to Hell.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.000
The majority of believers in God are

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:32.000
going to Hell because they do not believe that God is running everything.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:38.000
In SURA 8 verse 17, a classic example it is not you who killed them - that was

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:42.000
after the battle, one of the battles in early Islam - it is not you who killed

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:47.000
them, it is God who killed them. It is not you who threw when you threw the arrow

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.000
or the gun or whatever it was God who threw.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.000
And this is a very important conclusion and this is why I think this is the most

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.000
important KHITBA I ever given to you.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.000
I made a trip recently to Egypt and everything that happened in

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:18.000
that trip told me that we don't do anything. We do not do anything. God is doing everything.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.000
The timing of my arrival, the timing of

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:25.000
my leaving, I mean, I get on the telephone and say TWA, I'm changing my reservation

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.000
from Tuesday to Thursday. I decided to change my... I didn't decide anything.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:36.000
I didn't change anything. Believe me, God is doing it. God is doing everything.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:43.000
In SURA number 12, again, the brothers of Joseph decided not to kill him, right?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:48.000
They think they decided not to kill him. They decided to throw him in the well.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:55.000
But before this happens, way before this, years before they make this so-called decision of theirs,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:04.000
Joseph sees the dream, the Sun, the Moon and eleven stars bowing before him

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.000
which is his father, his mother, and his 11 brother bowing before him,

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:15.000
something that was to happen after he's practically ruling Egypt as a man.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:20.000
So, one day the brothers met to kill him. They...

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.000
The decision was already made. They could not decide to kill him. It was impossible.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.000
But here they are meeting and they're taking votes shall we kill him?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:35.000
What shall we do with him? And then they decided, they think, not to kill him.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:41.000
God is running everything. And this is our new ZIKR. Just keep telling

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:45.000
yourself God is running everything especially when you are at the brink of

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.000
objecting to something or losing your temper.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:56.000
When you lose your temper, tell yourself you must separate yourself from you

00:09:56.000 --> 00:010:01.000
as of now. When you lose your temper against a friend or a spouse or a brother or

00:010:01.000 --> 00:010:08.000
a sister or anybody in the street, you tell yourself you're not a Muslim.

00:010:08.000 --> 00:010:11.000
You're objecting. Because God is running everything.

00:010:11.000 --> 00:010:15.000
Believe me. When your friend or your wife or your husband behaves in a certain way that

00:010:15.000 --> 00:010:23.000
gets in your nerves, God is doing it and it's because you deserve it.

00:010:23.000 --> 00:010:29.000
So, you have to get on yourself, and correct your self,

00:010:29.000 --> 00:010:35.000
and catch yourself objecting, not submitting to God. God runs everything.

00:010:42.000 --> 00:010:47.000
I wanna give you an example so you understand how God is running everything

00:010:47.000 --> 00:010:49.000
and how we have the freedom of choice.

00:010:52.000 --> 00:011:00.000
Suppose I had a temporary ability of traveling in the future, let's say for one week.

00:011:00.000 --> 00:011:05.000
I travel in the future and I see what happened to you, what decision you made.

00:011:05.000 --> 00:011:11.000
Okay. So, I traveled all the way to the next Friday and I saw exactly where you went,

00:011:11.000 --> 00:011:15.000
what kind of decision you made. Now back to this Friday, I'm giving you a choice

00:011:15.000 --> 00:011:19.000
to go to New York or to California. I wanna give you a

00:011:19.000 --> 00:011:24.000
choice to go to either New York or California. So, I'm giving you a choice.

00:011:24.000 --> 00:011:29.000
You're going to freely choose California or New York for your trip,

00:011:29.000 --> 00:011:34.000
but I already know, see, because I travelled in time this one week and I know that you

00:011:34.000 --> 00:011:39.000
decided to go to California. So, even though I'm giving you the freedom of choice,

00:011:39.000 --> 00:011:43.000
I know exactly what you're going to do and where you're going.

00:011:43.000 --> 00:011:49.000
But it is much more than this. I don't think we can really understand it.

00:011:49.000 --> 00:011:55.000
God runs everything and this is the condition. This is a quality of God and if you

00:011:55.000 --> 00:011:58.000
don't know this quality, you don't know God and you don't believe in God.

00:011:58.000 --> 00:012:04.000
And this is what the Quran means by all these verses.

00:012:04.000 --> 00:012:14.000
When Satan inflicts disasters, diseases, cancer on people,

00:012:14.000 --> 00:012:20.000
Satan is doing this in accordance with God's law, and we see this in the Quran.

00:012:20.000 --> 00:012:25.000
I remind you of the example of the disciples of Jesus, when they

00:012:25.000 --> 00:012:31.000
demanded a feast from the sky, and God said okay. I'm gonna send it down but if any

00:012:31.000 --> 00:012:39.000
of you disbelieves, I will punish him severely more than anybody that I ever punished.

00:012:39.000 --> 00:012:42.000
Now, you know that the punisher would really be Satan,

00:012:42.000 --> 00:012:49.000
but God - this is God's law. When they disbelieve, they step out of God's Kingdom, then Satan will inflict

00:012:49.000 --> 00:012:56.000
the damage, but God is doing everything. So, even the actions of Satan

00:012:56.000 --> 00:013:01.000
are under God's control. God is running everything. God will not be a god if He

00:013:01.000 --> 00:013:05.000
wasn't running everything.

00:013:05.000 --> 00:013:08.000
So, this is a quality of God that you must recognize and we're going to

00:013:08.000 --> 00:013:14.000
commemorate. This is in our own language, in English, and you drive your car and

00:013:14.000 --> 00:013:18.000
you say God is running everything, and you look at everything and you say God

00:013:18.000 --> 00:013:25.000
is running everything, because this is the condition of belief in God.

00:013:25.000 --> 00:013:30.000
The Quran says very clearly when something good happens to you, it is from God,

00:013:30.000 --> 00:013:35.000
when something bad happens to you, it is from you, but God is running everything.

00:013:35.000 --> 00:013:38.000
God created the fire. You can use it to

00:013:38.000 --> 00:013:48.000
cook a steak from a raw steak to a delicious cooked steak, unless you like it raw.

00:013:48.000 --> 00:013:52.000
But you can also put your finger in that fire and burn your finger.

00:013:52.000 --> 00:013:56.000
So, God created the fire to be in your service, but if you choose to put your

00:013:56.000 --> 00:014:02.000
finger in it and suffer, then this is from you, not from God.

00:014:02.000 --> 00:014:10.000
But it is God's law that made the fire as burning. If you put your finger in it, it burns. It's God's law.

00:014:10.000 --> 00:014:12.000
It's one of the physical laws. There are many invisible laws

00:014:12.000 --> 00:014:16.000
like if you disobey God, if you go drink, for example, it's exactly

00:014:16.000 --> 00:014:21.000
like putting your finger in the fire but the punishment is not as visible.

00:014:21.000 --> 00:014:27.000
You can be sure you'll pay. It's just like that, like the fire putting your finger in it.

00:014:27.000 --> 00:014:33.000
Alcohol and drinking it, drugs and taking them, adultery and committing it,

00:014:33.000 --> 00:014:39.000
all these things, they're laws that God's laws govern them and the punishment,

00:014:39.000 --> 00:014:46.000
the physical - the fire, putting your finger in it, the punishment for the sins are exactly in the same way,

00:014:46.000 --> 00:014:53.000
but they're not as visible. They're just as painful if not worse.

00:014:53.000 --> 00:014:56.000
And this explains all the problems we see in the world,

00:014:56.000 --> 00:015:05.000
the people breaking God's law and paying the price, just like putting their finger in the fire.

00:015:05.000 --> 00:015:11.000
What is our role? What do we do? God is doing everything.

00:015:11.000 --> 00:015:17.000
We do only one thing, one decision: to be with God or not.

00:015:17.000 --> 00:015:25.000
After that God takes over. But we are absolutely free in that decision.

00:015:25.000 --> 00:015:33.000
To submit is already done, and the choice, our choice is to willingly submit or unwillingly submit.

00:015:33.000 --> 00:015:39.000
And those people who don't believe in God out there, they are submitting to God, except unwillingly.

00:015:39.000 --> 00:015:47.000
I mean, they can't control the number of beats of their heart for example. I mean, this is one of the visible things.

00:015:47.000 --> 00:015:52.000
But God runs everything. When Reagan decides to agree with the

00:015:52.000 --> 00:015:56.000
Russians on limiting nuclear weapons, he's not deciding anything. He's just like

00:015:56.000 --> 00:016:02.000
Joseph's brothers. He thinks he's deciding to meet with the Russians

00:016:02.000 --> 00:016:06.000
or vice versa. But God runs everything.

00:016:11.000 --> 00:016:16.000
We know also that the Angels are as free as we are,

00:016:16.000 --> 00:016:24.000
from the incident where Satan refused to obey God and bow down before Adam.

00:016:24.000 --> 00:016:28.000
God wants His creatures to be free, as far as that decision is concerned until

00:016:28.000 --> 00:016:32.000
the Day of Judgement. The eternal Day of Judgement, there's

00:016:32.000 --> 00:016:39.000
no more. We'll see everything, and we'll submit. Everybody will submit

00:016:39.000 --> 00:016:44.000
including the dwellers of Hell.

00:016:54.000 --> 00:017:04.000
It turns out that if we believe that anybody is doing anything, this is SHIRK. This is idol worship.

00:017:04.000 --> 00:017:10.000
You're putting somebody who's doing something with God, next to God,

00:017:10.000 --> 00:017:15.000
it negates the idea that God runs everything.

00:017:15.000 --> 00:017:26.000
So, if you think anybody is doing anything, I mean, this is by definition is SHIRK, idolatry.

00:017:26.000 --> 00:017:32.000
This is why we're gonna remind ourselves to remind ourselves against Satan's ideas,

00:017:32.000 --> 00:017:36.000
we're gonna always say God runs everything.

00:017:36.000 --> 00:017:40.000
You're gonna do it for a while, and then you'll forget, like I forget.

00:017:40.000 --> 00:017:44.000
So, I'm gonna keep after me and after you, and we're gonna repeat that.

00:017:44.000 --> 00:017:49.000
I'm gonna remind you, and you remind me, and we will always continuously until every

00:017:49.000 --> 00:017:53.000
cell in our body is declaring: God is running everything.

00:017:53.000 --> 00:017:59.000
Because this, like I said, sheds a whole new light on Submission, the idea of Submission.

00:017:59.000 --> 00:018:04.000
And this sign out there on the wall Happiness is Submission to God

00:018:04.000 --> 00:018:09.000
is a profound sign. There's a lot more to it than meets the eye.

00:018:09.000 --> 00:018:15.000
You're gonna be perfectly happy, and this ZIKR God runs everything

00:018:15.000 --> 00:018:19.000
is going to help you into total Submission because anytime you start to

00:018:19.000 --> 00:018:23.000
complain or object, you're gonna remind yourself God runs everything.

00:018:23.000 --> 00:018:29.000
I'm complaining against God. I'm complaining that God is doing this, so I'm complaining, I don't like it.

00:018:34.000 --> 00:018:41.000
We sometimes we turn into complainers, and we have to catch ourselves.

00:018:44.000 --> 00:018:49.000
Complainers will complain when things are good. They complain when things are bad.

00:018:49.000 --> 00:018:59.000
They get into a rut and they'll complain continuously. That's objection. That's the opposite of Submission.

00:018:59.000 --> 00:019:07.000
There's a good example of decisions. The May issue of the Muslim Perspective,

00:019:07.000 --> 00:019:10.000
we decided to print a certain number and we said okay, we're

00:019:10.000 --> 00:019:14.000
gonna get to these Muslim organizations. They don't deserve the

00:019:14.000 --> 00:019:19.000
Muslim Perspective anyway. So, we're gonna skip one, do one and skip one.

00:019:19.000 --> 00:019:25.000
So, we'll send only Muslim Perspectives to half of them, and okay we made a decision, right?

00:019:25.000 --> 00:019:30.000
We make decisions, but God makes the decision and God's decision prevails.

00:019:30.000 --> 00:019:34.000
So, the next day, the press they called me and they say guess what, we made a mistake.

00:019:34.000 --> 00:019:43.000
I said what? Said we changed the page. They printed one page on the wrong side.

00:019:43.000 --> 00:019:49.000
So, they have to do it over, for nothing. So, we ended up with a large

00:019:49.000 --> 00:019:54.000
number of Muslim Perspectives anyway and we had to send every, you know, the Muslim Perspective to everybody.

00:019:54.000 --> 00:020:01.000
But this is an example of deciding, right? We decided to eliminate these names,

00:020:01.000 --> 00:020:05.000
but God decided No! You're gonna send it to every single one of them.

00:020:05.000 --> 00:020:07.000
God runs everything.

00:020:20.000 --> 00:020:22.000
Tooboo Ela Allah. Repent.

00:020:36.000 --> 00:020:41.000
Alhamdu Lillah. Wa Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah.

00:020:44.000 --> 00:020:49.000
I believe this ZIKR is very important, very significant and I believe

00:020:49.000 --> 00:020:55.000
is gonna help all of us. So, I'm going to repeat again, impress on you that

00:020:55.000 --> 00:020:59.000
whenever you have a chance continuously God is running everything.

00:020:59.000 --> 00:021:02.000
God is running everything. God is running everything.

00:021:02.000 --> 00:021:09.000
silently and loudly, every chance you get, and eventually, like I said, every cell in

00:021:09.000 --> 00:021:17.000
your body will be pronouncing this important decision. This is the requirement to make it to Heaven.

00:021:24.000 --> 00:021:31.000
I want to talk again about being upset and fighting with anybody.

00:021:31.000 --> 00:021:40.000
Being upset, complaining, fighting, for your own good, you shouldn't do that.

00:021:40.000 --> 00:021:46.000
We should not do that for our own good because it backfires manifold.

00:021:46.000 --> 00:021:51.000
When you say a hurting word, or a hurting look.

00:021:51.000 --> 00:022:01.000
The Quran goes all the way to suspicion. Inside of your head if you suspect, if you're suspicious of some...

00:022:01.000 --> 00:022:05.000
you know, you look at me and I have a stomachache or something, and I'm making a face,

00:022:05.000 --> 00:022:09.000
and you say this guy is not friendly to me, you've committed a sin.

00:022:09.000 --> 00:022:15.000
And it's gonna backfire on you. You're the one who's going to suffer.

00:022:15.000 --> 00:022:21.000
You must seek excuses for the people. If I pass by you and I'm making a face,

00:022:21.000 --> 00:022:27.000
it is not because I hate you, probably I do, okay, maybe I do, but what you are

00:022:27.000 --> 00:022:33.000
supposed to do is oh, he must have a headache or a stomachache or something is bothering him.

00:022:33.000 --> 00:022:38.000
And you love me instead of hate me, for your own good.

00:022:38.000 --> 00:022:43.000
But if I am making a face, if I'm passing by you and I'm making a face

00:022:43.000 --> 00:022:47.000
and you assume that I do it because I don't like you, and it is true, even that

00:022:47.000 --> 00:022:56.000
little suspicion in your head will hurt you, will backfire on you, so let alone being loud, calling names.

